{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生成模型：从潜变量与对抗学习到 diffusion、flow 与 consistency</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generative, Diffusion &amp; Flow</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_121_glow-title\">Glow</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">Glow 在 RealNVP coupling 上加入数据依赖 ActNorm 和可学习可逆 1×1 通道卷积。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Enhances multi-scale affine coupling flows with activation normalization (ActNorm) and learnable invertible 1×1 channel convolutions parameterized via LU decomposition.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">连续化图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Continuous-valued image x</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">精确似然和层级潜变量，或由潜变量反演的生成图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Hierarchical latent variables z, exact log-likelihood log p(x), and exact latent-to-image synthesis</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper/2018/hash/d139db6a236200b21cc7f752979132d0-Abstract.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_121_glow')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_121_glow')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Glow original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/7a61aa0f67c06be9cb68.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_121_glow', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_121_glow\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_121_glow')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_121_glow', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_121_glow\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">连续化图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">continuous</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">离散像素加入噪声并做 logit/尺度预处理</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests continuous-valued image x and prepares initial tensor representations (continuous).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"离散像素加入噪声并做 logit/尺度预处理\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests continuous-valued image x and prepares initial tensor representations (continuous).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"连续化图像\" data-node-name-en=\"continuous\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_121_glow', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">连续化图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">continuous</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">离散像素加入噪声并做 logit/尺度预处理</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests continuous-valued image x and prepares initial tensor representations (continuous).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将空间 2×2 邻域重排到通道维\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Squeeze to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Squeeze\" data-node-name-en=\"Squeeze\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_121_glow', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Squeeze</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将空间 2×2 邻域重排到通道维</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Squeeze to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每通道可逆仿射变换，首批数据依赖初始化\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs ActNorm within the core invertible 1x1 conv multiscale flow computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"ActNorm\" data-node-name-en=\"ActNorm\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_121_glow', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>ActNorm</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每通道可逆仿射变换，首批数据依赖初始化</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs ActNorm within the core invertible 1x1 conv multiscale flow computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"学习完整可逆通道混合，替代固定 permutation\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Invertible 1×1 convolution within the core invertible 1x1 conv multiscale flow computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Invertible 1×1 convolution\" data-node-name-en=\"Invertible 1×1 convolution\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_121_glow', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Invertible 1×1 convolution</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">学习完整可逆通道混合，替代固定 permutation</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Invertible 1×1 convolution within the core invertible 1x1 conv multiscale flow computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"一半通道条件化另一半的 scale 与 shift\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Affine coupling within the core invertible 1x1 conv multiscale flow computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Affine coupling\" data-node-name-en=\"Affine coupling\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_121_glow', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Affine coupling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">一半通道条件化另一半的 scale 与 shift</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Affine coupling within the core invertible 1x1 conv multiscale flow computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每层级分出 latent，并对剩余特征继续 flow\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Multi-scale split within the core invertible 1x1 conv multiscale flow computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Multi-scale split\" data-node-name-en=\"Multi-scale split\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_121_glow', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Multi-scale split</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每层级分出 latent，并对剩余特征继续 flow</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Multi-scale split within the core invertible 1x1 conv multiscale flow computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"累加 ActNorm、1×1 conv 和 coupling 的 log-det\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies change-of-variables to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"精确 change-of-variables\" data-node-name-en=\"change-of-variables\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_121_glow', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">精确 change-of-variables</span><span class=\"lang-en\">change-of-variables</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">累加 ActNorm、1×1 conv 和 coupling 的 log-det</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies change-of-variables to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从高斯先验采样并严格反演全部步骤\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces hierarchical latent variables z, exact log-likelihood log p(x), and exact latent-to-image synthesis via hierarchical z.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"层级 z / 逆向样本\" data-node-name-en=\"hierarchical z\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_121_glow', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">层级 z / 逆向样本</span><span class=\"lang-en\">hierarchical z</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从高斯先验采样并严格反演全部步骤</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces hierarchical latent variables z, exact log-likelihood log p(x), and exact latent-to-image synthesis via hierarchical z.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Glow Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · ActNorm、可逆 1×1 卷积与耦合层的流似然</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Multi-Scale Flow Step Combining ActNorm, Invertible 1×1 Convolution &amp; Affine Coupling</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Glow：核心公式 · ActNorm、可逆 1×1 卷积与耦合层的流似然\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"121\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"21.325013pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.463972 -69.011212 410.589816 21.325013\" width=\"410.589816pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M5.697191-3.275389V-3.831212H.615376V-3.275389H5.697191ZM5.697191-1.260528V-1.816352H.615376V-1.260528H5.697191Z\" id=\"m121_g1-61\"></path><path d=\"M4.202424-.253595L2.586665-1.862109L4.202424-3.477869L3.912602-3.767691L2.304088-2.151931L.695574-3.767691L.405751-3.477869L2.014266-1.862109L.405751-.253595L.695574 .036228L2.304088-1.579532L3.912602 .036228L4.202424-.253595Z\" id=\"m121_g7-2\"></path><path d=\"M2.151931-2.977925C2.151931-3.23152 1.891091-3.405413 1.659233-3.405413C1.391147-3.405413 1.260727-3.144573 1.188272-2.927206L.434734-.731802C.412997-.6