20-49\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"292.047862\" xlink:href=\"#m121_g10-106\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"296.652759\" xlink:href=\"#m121_g10-184\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"305.202861\" xlink:href=\"#m121_g4-213\" y=\"-69.011212\"></use><use x=\"320.302858\" xlink:href=\"#m121_g16-66\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"324.925517\" xlink:href=\"#m121_g10-185\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"329.000235\" xlink:href=\"#m121_g16-17\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"334.435347\" xlink:href=\"#m121_g13-48\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"339.2971\" xlink:href=\"#m121_g10-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">RealNVP 固定通道置换限制特征混合，深层训练初始化不稳</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Fixed channel permutations in RealNVP restricted cross-channel mixing, and small-batch flow training suffered from activation instability.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在多尺度 flow 中用 actnorm、可逆 1×1 卷积和仿射 coupling 学习精确似然</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Replace fixed channel reversals with a learnable invertible 1×1 convolution and stabilize deep flow training via data-dependent ActNorm.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">可学习可逆通道混合与数据依赖归一化提升生成质量</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">ActNorm (scale/bias per channel) + LU-factored invertible 1×1 convolution reducing log-det cost from O(C³) to O(C).</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">常作医学 normalizing-flow 生成和异常检测结构基础</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Used as an exact-likelihood generative prior for medical inverse problems and unsupervised brain MRI anomaly scoring.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">经典 flow 架构；内存与似然语义问题限制临床直接应用</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Classic flow milestone; bijective dimensionality preservation makes high-resolution 3D flows memory-intensive compared to latent diffusion.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">每个 flow step 依次执行 ActNorm、可逆 1×1 卷积和 affine coupling。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">可逆 1×1 卷积学习通道置换，比固定 shuffle 更灵活。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">多尺度 squeeze/split 建立层级 latent，并保留精确 change-of-variables 似然。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Replace fixed channel reversals with a learnable invertible 1×1 convolution and stabilize deep flow training via data-dependent ActNorm.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: ActNorm (scale/bias per channel) + LU-factored invertible 1×1 convolution reducing log-det cost from O(C³) to O(C).</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Multi-Scale Flow Step Combining ActNorm, Invertible 1×1 Convolution &amp; Affine Coupling.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">是医学 normalizing-flow 生成、异常检测和不确定性建模的常用结构母体。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">精确密度可能偏好平滑或低复杂度扫描，异常分数需与设备、重建核和人群协变量解耦。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Used as an exact-likelihood generative prior for medical inverse problems and unsupervised brain MRI anomaly scoring.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Classic flow milestone; bijective dimensionality preservation makes high-resolution 3D flows memory-intensive compared to latent diffusion.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper/2018/hash/d139db6a236200b21cc7f752979132d0-Abstract.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Glow: Generative Flow with Invertible 1×1 Convolutions</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/glow\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
